  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Life sphere, Combat Stamina.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use a Life sphere ability on an ally that restores hit points or grants temporary hit points, they regain 1 point of stamina for every 5 points regained or granted, respectively. This occurs even if they do not benefit from all points granted (such as an uninjured person being healed).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/life#toc69\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
